From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Mon, 16 Feb 2026 13:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add projector settings UI for Unihertz/Agold devices

Add a new Projector settings section to the TrebleDroid settings app,
visible only on devices with both the Agold daemon service and projector
sysfs nodes present.

Controls include: projector power/mode, display toggle, brightness,
keystone correction, auto/manual focus, fan speed, temperature readout,
and laser ranging distance (when hardware is available).

Focus calibration is automatically sent before enabling the projector
to ensure a sharp image.
